msgid ""
"``queue_free()`` is a function that essentially 'frees', or deletes, the "
"node at the end of the frame."
msgstr "``queue_free()`` 是一个函数，基本上是在帧结束时“释放”或删除节点。"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/04.creating_the_enemy.rst:134
