msgstr ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>`\\ （名为 ``MobTimer``\\ ）——控制怪物产生的频率"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:21
msgid ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (named ``ScoreTimer``) - to increment the score "
