msgstr ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>`\\ （名为 ``StartTimer``\\ ）——在开始之前给出延迟"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:25
msgid ""
":ref:`Marker2D <class_Marker2D>` (named ``StartPosition``) - to indicate the "
