msgstr "在图像上放置点 ``4`` 后，点击 ``闭合曲线`` 按钮，你的曲线将完成。"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:63
msgid ""
"Now that the path is defined, add a :ref:`PathFollow2D <class_PathFollow2D>` "
