"Now that we're done creating the ``HUD`` scene, go back to ``Main``. "
"Instance the ``HUD`` scene in ``Main`` like you did the ``Player`` scene. "
"The scene tree should look like this, so make sure you didn't miss anything:"
msgstr ""
