#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:4
msgid "Using the Android editor"
msgstr "使用 Android 编辑器"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:6
msgid ""
"In 2023, we added an `Android port of the editor <https://godotengine.org/"
"article/android_godot_editor_play_store_beta_release/>`__ that can be used "
"to create, develop, and export 2D and 3D projects on Android devices."
msgstr ""
"2023 年，我们添加了 \\`Android 端的编辑器 <https://godotengine.org/article/"
"android_godot_editor_play_store_beta_release/>`__\\ ，可用于在 Android 设备上"
"创建、开发和导出 2D 和 3D 项目。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:9
msgid ""
"The app can be downloaded from the `Godot download page <https://"
"godotengine.org/download/android/>`__ or from the `Google Play Store "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.godotengine.editor.v4>`__."
msgstr ""
"该应用可以从 `Godot 下载页面 <https://godotengine.org/download/android/>`__ "
"或 `Google Play 商店 <https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?"
"id=org.godotengine.editor.v4>`__ 下载。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:14
msgid ""
"The Android editor is in early access, while we continue to refine the "
"experience. See :ref:`doc_using_the_android_editor_limitations` below."
msgstr ""
"Android 编辑器目前处于抢先体验阶段，我们将继续完善用户体验。请参阅下面"
"的 :ref:`doc_using_the_android_editor_limitations` 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:17
msgid "Android devices support"
msgstr "Android 设备支持"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:19
msgid ""
"The Android editor requires devices running Android 5 Lollipop or higher, "
"with at least OpenGL 3 support. This includes (not exhaustive):"
msgstr ""
"Android 编辑器需要运行在 Android 5 Lollipop 或更高版本的设备上，并且至少支持 "
"OpenGL 3。 这些设备包括（并非详尽无遗）："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:21
msgid "Android tablets, foldables and large phones"
msgstr "Android 平板、折叠机、大屏手机"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:22
msgid "Android-powered netbooks"
msgstr "Android 上网本"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:23
msgid "Chromebooks supporting Android apps"
msgstr "支持 Android 应用的 Chromebook"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:39
msgid ""
"For the best experience and high level of productivity, connecting a "
"bluetooth keyboard & mouse is recommended to interact with the Android "
"editor. The Android editor supports all of the `usual shortcuts and key "
"mappings <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/editor/"
"default_key_mapping.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"为了获得最佳体验和高生产力，建议连接蓝牙键盘和鼠标来与 Android 编辑器进行交"
"互。Android 编辑器支持所有 \\`常用快捷键和键位映射 <https://"
"docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/editor/"
"default_key_mapping.html>`__\\。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:41
msgid ""
"When interacting with keyboard & mouse, you can decrease the size of the "
"scrollbar using the `interface/touchscreen/increase_scrollbar_touch_area "
"<https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/"
"class_editorsettings.html#class-editorsettings-property-interface-"
"touchscreen-increase-scrollbar-touch-area>`__ editor setting."
msgstr ""
"当使用键盘和鼠标进行交互时，你可以通过 `interface/touchscreen/"
"increase_scrollbar_touch_area <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/"
"classes/class_editorsettings.html#class-editorsettings-property-interface-"
"touchscreen-increase-scrollbar-touch-area>`__ 编辑器设置来减小滚动条的大小。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:42
msgid ""
"For 2D projects, the `block coding plugin <https://godotengine.org/asset-"
"library/asset/3095>`__ can provide a block-based visual alternative to "
"composing scripts when lacking a connected hardware keyboard."
msgstr ""
"对于 2D 项目，当缺少连接的硬件键盘时，`block coding 插件 <https://"
"godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/3095>`__ 可以提供基于块的可视化替代方案来"
"编写脚本。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:44
msgid "**Multi-tasking**"
msgstr "**多任务**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:46
msgid ""
"On smaller devices, enabling and using picture-in-picture (PiP) mode "
"provides the ability to easily transition between the *Editor* and the *Play "
"window*."
msgstr ""
"在较小的设备上，启用并使用画中画（PiP）模式可以让你轻松地在 *编辑器* 和 "
"*Play 窗口* 之间切换。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:48
msgid ""
"PiP can be enabled via the `run/window_placement/play_window_pip_mode "
"<https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/"
"class_editorsettings.html#class-editorsettings-property-run-window-placement-"
"play-window-pip-mode>`__ editor setting."
msgstr ""
"PiP 可以通过 `run/window_placement/play_window_pip_mode <https://"
"docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_editorsettings.html#class-"
"editorsettings-property-run-window-placement-play-window-pip-mode>`__ 编辑器"
"设置来启用。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:49
msgid ""
"The `run/window_placement/android_window <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/"
"latest/classes/class_editorsettings.html#class-editorsettings-property-run-"
"window-placement-android-window>`__ editor setting can be used to specify "
"whether the *Play* window should always launch in PiP mode."
msgstr ""
"`run/window_placement/android_window <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/"
"classes/class_editorsettings.html#class-editorsettings-property-run-window-"
"placement-android-window>`__ 编辑器设置可用于指定 *Play* 窗口是否应始终在 "
"PiP 模式下启动。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:50
msgid "**Note:** In PiP mode, the *Play* window does not have input access."
msgstr "**注意：**\\ 在画中画模式下，\\ *播放*\\ 窗口无法进行输入。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:69
msgid "Here are the known limitations and issues of the Android editor:"
msgstr "以下是 Android 编辑器的已知局限性和问题："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:73
msgid ""
"While available, the Forward+ renderer is not recommended due to severe "
"performance issues."
msgstr "Forward+ 渲染器虽然可用，但是由于存在严重的性能问题，所以不推荐使用。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:74
msgid "UX not optimized for Android phones form-factor."
msgstr "UX 未针对 Android 手机的尺寸进行优化。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:75
msgid ""
"`Android Go devices <https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/"
"androidgo>`__ lacks the *All files access* permission required for device "
"read/write access. As a workaround, when using an Android Go device, it's "
"recommended to create new projects only in the Android *Documents* or "
"*Downloads* directories."
msgstr ""
"`Android Go 设备 <https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/androidgo>`__\\ "
"缺少设备读写访问所需的\\ *全部文件访问*\\ 权限。作为变通方法，在使用 Android "
"Go 设备时建议只在 Android 的 *Documents* 或 *Downloads* 目录中创建新项目。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:78
msgid ""
"The editor doesn't properly resume when *Don't keep activities* is enabled "
"in the *Developer Options*."
msgstr "在 *开发者选项* 中启用 *不保留活动* 后，编辑器将无法正常恢复。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:79
msgid ""
"There is a `bug <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/70751>`__ with "
"the Samsung keyboard that causes random input to be inserted when writing "
"scripts. It's recommended to use the `Google keyboard (Gboard) <https://"
"play.google.com/store/apps/details?"
"id=com.google.android.inputmethod.latin>`__ instead."
msgstr ""
"三星键盘存在一个 `bug <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/"
"70751>`__\\ ，会导致在编写脚本时随机插入输入。建议使用 `Google 键盘"
"（Gboard） <https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?"
"id=com.google.android.inputmethod.latin>`__\\ 替代。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_android_editor.rst:84
msgid ""
"See the `list of open issues on GitHub related to the Android editor "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues?"
"q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3Aplatform%3Aandroid+label%3Atopic%3Aeditor>`__ "
"for a list of known bugs."
msgstr ""
"请参阅\\ `GitHub 上与 Android 编辑器有关的问题列表 <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/issues?"
"q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3Aplatform%3Ahtml5+label%3Atopic%3Aeditor>`__\\ "
"来了解已知 Bug 列表。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:6
msgid "Using the Web editor"
msgstr "使用 Web 编辑器"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:8
msgid ""
"There is a `Web editor <https://editor.godotengine.org/>`__ you can use to "
"work on new or existing projects."
msgstr ""
"你可以用 `Web 编辑器\\ <https://editor.godotengine.org/>`__\\ 来处理新的或现"
"有的项目。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:13
msgid ""
"The web editor is in a preliminary stage. While its feature set may be "
"sufficient for educational purposes, it is currently **not recommended for "
"production work**. See :ref:`doc_using_the_web_editor_limitations` below."
msgstr ""
"Web 编辑器尚处于初步阶段。虽然其功能集可能足以满足教学目的，但目前\\ **不建议"
"用于生产工作**\\ 。请参阅下面的"
"《\\ :ref:`doc_using_the_web_editor_limitations`\\ 》。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:18
msgid "Browser support"
msgstr "浏览器支持"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:20
msgid ""
"The Web editor requires support for WebAssembly's SharedArrayBuffer. This is "
"in turn required to support threading in the browser."
msgstr ""
"Web 编辑器需要支持 WebAssembly 的 SharedArrayBuffer。而这也是支持浏览器中做多"
"线程的必要条件。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:23
msgid ""
"See :ref:`doc_system_requirements` for a list of supported web browsers. "
"Mobile browsers are supported, but won't provide an ideal experience due to "
"performance and input limitations."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`doc_system_requirements` 获取支持的 Web 浏览器列表。移动浏览器是"
"受支持的，但由于性能和输入限制，无法提供理想的体验。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:27
msgid ""
"The web editor only supports the Compatibility renderer, as there is no "
"stable way to run Vulkan applications on the web yet."
msgstr ""
"由于目前还没有稳定的方法在 Web 上运行 Vulkan 应用程序，因此 Web 编辑器仅支持"
"兼容性渲染器 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:32
msgid ""
"If you run into performance issues on Firefox, try using a Chromium-based "
"browser as these may perform better in WebGL applications."
msgstr ""
"如果你在Firefox上遇到性能问题，可以尝试使用基于Chromium的浏览器，因为这些浏览"
"器在WebGL应用中表现可能更好。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:38
#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_engine_compilation_configuration_editor.rst:89
#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/3d_text.rst:55
#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/3d_text.rst:106
#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/3d_text.rst:147
#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/using_decals.rst:251
#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/particles/subemitters.rst:67
#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/global_illumination/reflection_probes.rst:178
#: ../../docs/tutorials/assets_pipeline/exporting_3d_scenes.rst:24
#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_web.rst:221
#: ../../docs/tutorials/performance/general_optimization.rst:78
#: ../../docs/tutorials/physics/large_world_coordinates.rst:222
#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/xr_full_screen_effects.rst:67
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:40
msgid ""
"Due to limitations on the Godot or Web platform side, the following features "
"are currently missing:"
msgstr "由于受到 Godot 或 Web 平台端的限制，目前缺少以下特性："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:44
msgid "No GDExtension support."
msgstr "不支持 GDExtension。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:45
msgid ""
"No debugging support. This means GDScript debugging/profiling, live scene "
"editing, the Remote Scene tree dock and other features that rely on the "
"debugger protocol will not work."
msgstr ""
"没有调试支持。这意味着 GDScript 调试/分析、场景编辑、远程场景树栏目和其他依赖"
"调试器支持功能将无法工作。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:48
msgid ""
"No project exporting. As a workaround, you can download the project source "
"using **Project > Tools > Download Project Source** and export it using a "
"`native version of the Godot editor <https://godotengine.org/download>`__."
msgstr ""
"没有项目导出。作为变通，你可以使用\\ **项目 > 工具 > Download Project "
"Source**, 然后使用\\ `原生版本的 Godot 编辑器\\ <https://godotengine.org/"
"download>`__\\ 导出。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:51
msgid "The editor won't warn you when closing the tab with unsaved changes."
msgstr "当关闭带有未保存更改的选项卡时，编辑器不会警告你。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:52
msgid ""
"No lightmap baking support. You can still use existing lightmaps if they "
"were baked with a native version of the Godot editor (e.g. by importing an "
"existing project)."
msgstr ""
"不支持光照贴图烘焙。你仍然可以使用现有的光照贴图，如果它们是用原生版本的 "
"Godot 编辑器烘焙的（例如，通过导入现有的项目）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:56
msgid ""
"The following features are unlikely to be supported due to inherent "
"limitations of the Web platform:"
msgstr "由于 Web 平台的固有局限，不太可能支持以下特性："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:60
msgid "No support for Android one-click deploy."
msgstr "不支持 Android 一键部署。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:64
msgid ""
"See the `list of open issues on GitHub related to the web editor <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/issues?"
"q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3Aplatform%3Aweb+label%3Atopic%3Aeditor>`__ for "
"a list of known bugs."
msgstr ""
"参见 \\`GitHub 上与 Web 编辑器相关的未解决问题列表 <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/issues?"
"q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3Aplatform%3Ahtml5+label%3Atopic%3Aeditor>`__\\ "
"了解已知的 Bug 列表。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:69
msgid "Importing a project"
msgstr "导入项目"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:71
msgid "To import an existing project, the current process is as follows:"
msgstr "要导入一个现有的项目, 目前的流程如下:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:73
msgid ""
"Specify a ZIP file to preload on the HTML5 filesystem using the **Preload "
"project ZIP** input."
msgstr ""
"使用\\ **Preload project ZIP** 输入，指定一个要在 HTML5 文件系统上预加载的 "
"ZIP 文件。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:75
msgid ""
"Run the editor by clicking **Start Godot editor**. The Godot Project Manager "
"should appear after 10-20 seconds. On slower machines or connections, "
"loading may take up to a minute."
msgstr ""
"点击\\ **Start Godot editor**\\ 来运行编辑器。Godot 项目管理器应在 10-20 秒后"
"出现。在较慢的机器或连接上，加载可能需要长达一分钟。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:78
msgid ""
"In the dialog that appears at the middle of the window, specify a name for "
"the folder to create then click the **Create Folder** button (it doesn't "
"have to match the ZIP archive's name)."
msgstr ""
"在窗口中间出现的对话框中，为要创建的文件夹指定一个名称，然后单击\\ **创建文件"
"夹**\\ 按钮（不必与 ZIP 存档的名称相一致）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:81
msgid "Click **Install & Edit** and the project will open in the editor."
msgstr "点击\\ **安装并编辑**\\ ，项目将在编辑器中打开。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:85
msgid ""
"It's important to place the project folder somewhere in ``/home/web_user/``. "
"If your project folder is placed outside ``/home/web_user/``, you will lose "
"your project when closing the editor!"
msgstr ""
"将项目文件夹放在 ``/home/web_user/`` 中很重要. 如果你的项目文件夹放在 ``/"
"home/web_user/`` 之外, 当你关闭编辑器时, 将失去项目!"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:89
msgid ""
"When you follow the steps described above, the project folder will always be "
"located in ``/home/web_user/projects``, keeping it safe."
msgstr ""
"当你按照上述步骤操作时, 项目文件夹将始终位于 ``/home/web_user/projects`` 中, "
"以保证其安全."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:93
msgid "Editing and running a project"
msgstr "编辑和运行一个项目"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:95
msgid ""
"Unlike the native version of Godot, the web editor is constrained to a "
"single window. Therefore, it cannot open a new window when running the "
"project. Instead, when you run the project by clicking the Run button or "
"pressing :kbd:`F5`, it will appear to \"replace\" the editor window."
msgstr ""
"与原生版本的Godot不同,web编辑器只限于一个窗口. 因此, 当运行项目时, 它不能打开"
"一个新窗口. 当你通过点击运行按钮或按 :kbd:`F5` 运行项目时, 它将出现 \"替换\" "
"编辑器窗口."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:100
msgid ""
"The web editor offers an alternative way to deal with the editor and game "
"windows (which are now \"tabs\"). You can switch between the **Editor** and "
"**Game** tabs using the buttons on the top. You can also close the running "
"game or editor by clicking the **×** button next to those tabs."
msgstr ""
"web编辑器提供了另一种处理编辑器和游戏窗口的方式(现在是 \"选项卡\" ). 你可以使"
"用顶部的按钮在 **Editor** 和 **Game** 选项卡之间切换. 你也可以通过点击这些选"
"项卡旁边的 **×** 按钮来关闭正在运行的游戏或编辑器."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:106
msgid "Where are my project files?"
msgstr "我的项目文件在哪里？"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:108
msgid ""
"Due to browser security limitations, the editor will save the project files "
"to the browser's IndexedDB storage. This storage isn't accessible as a "
"regular folder on your machine, but is abstracted away in a database."
msgstr ""
"由于浏览器的安全限制, 编辑器会将项目文件保存到浏览器的IndexedDB存储中. 这个存"
"储在你的机器上并不能以普通文件夹的形式访问, 而是被抽象在数据库中."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:115
msgid ""
"You can download the project files as a ZIP archive by using **Project > "
"Tools > Download Project Source**. This can be used to export the project "
"using a `native Godot editor <https://godotengine.org/download>`__, since "
"exporting from the web editor isn't supported yet."
msgstr ""
"你可以通过\\ **项目 > 工具 > Download Project Source**\\ ，将项目文件下载为 "
"ZIP 档案。这可以用来使用\\ `原生 Godot 编辑器 <https://godotengine.org/"
"download>`__\\ 导出项目，因为还不支持从 Web 编辑器导出。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.rst:120
msgid ""
"In the future, it may be possible to use the `HTML5 FileSystem API <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FileSystem>`__ to store the project "
"files on the user's filesystem as the native editor would do. However, this "
"isn't implemented yet."
msgstr ""
"将来可能会使用 `HTML5 FileSystem API <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/"
"docs/Web/API/FileSystem>`__ 来将项目文件存储在用户的文件系统中, 就像本地编辑"
"器那样, 然而, 这还没有实现."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:4
msgid "Command line tutorial"
msgstr "命令行教程"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:8
msgid ""
"Some developers like using the command line extensively. Godot is designed "
"to be friendly to them, so here are the steps for working entirely from the "
"command line. Given the engine relies on almost no external libraries, "
"initialization times are pretty fast, making it suitable for this workflow."
msgstr ""
"一些开发人员喜欢广泛使用命令行.Godot被设计为对他们友好, 所以这里是完全用命令"
"行工作的步骤. 由于引擎几乎不依赖外部库, 因此初始化时间非常快, 使其适合此工作"
"流程."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:16
msgid ""
"On Windows and Linux, you can run a Godot binary in a terminal by specifying "
"its relative or absolute path."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 和 Linux 上，你可以通过指定其相对或绝对路径在终端中运行 Godot 可执"
"行文件。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:19
msgid ""
"On macOS, the process is different due to Godot being contained within a "
"``.app`` bundle (which is a *folder*, not a file). To run a Godot binary "
"from a terminal on macOS, you have to ``cd`` to the folder where the Godot "
"application bundle is located, then run ``Godot.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot`` "
"followed by any command line arguments. If you've renamed the application "
"bundle from ``Godot`` to another name, make sure to edit this command line "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"在 macOS 上，由于 Godot 包含在 ``.app`` 包中（这是一个 *文件夹* ，而不是文"
"件），因此运行过程有所不同。要从 macOS 的终端运行 Godot 可执行文件，你必须 "
"``cd`` 到 Godot 应用程序包所在的文件夹，然后运行 ``Godot.app/Contents/MacOS/"
"Godot`` ，并在后面加上相关命令行参数。如果你把应用包从 ``Godot`` 改名为其他名"
"称，则需相应地编辑这个命令行。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:28
