"setter 方法。例如， PathFollow2D 和 PathFollow3D 的 ``set_offset()`` 和 "
"``get_offset()`` 必须分别重命名为 ``set_progress()`` 和 "
"``get_progress()``\\ 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:472
msgid "AudioServer's ``device`` is now ``output_device``."
msgstr "AudioServer 的 ``device`` 现在改为 ``output_device``\\ 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.rst:473
