#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:245
msgid ""
"In order to fix a serious bug, in Godot 4.1 we had to break binary "
"compatibility in a big way and source compatibility in a small way."
msgstr ""
"为了修复一个严重的错误，在 Godot 4.1 中，我们不得不在很大程度上打破二进制兼容"
"性，在很小程度上打破源代码兼容性。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:248
msgid ""
"This means that GDExtensions made for Godot 4.0 will need to be recompiled "
"for Godot 4.1 (using the  ``4.1`` branch of godot-cpp), with a small change "
"to their source code."
msgstr ""
"这意味着为 Godot 4.0 制作的 GDExtensions 将需要为 Godot 4.1 重新编译（使用 "
"godot-cpp 的 ``4.1`` 分支），并对其源代码稍作修改。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:251
msgid "In Godot 4.0, your \"entry_symbol\" function looks something like this:"
msgstr "在 Godot 4.0 中，你的“entry_symbol”函数应该是这样："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:265
msgid "However, for Godot 4.1, it should look like:"
msgstr "不过，对于 Godot 4.1 来说，它应该是这样的："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:279
msgid "There are two small changes:"
msgstr "有 2 个小改动："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:281
msgid ""
"The first argument changes from ``const GDExtensionInterface *p_interface`` "
"to ``GDExtensionInterfaceGetProcAddress p_get_proc_address``"
msgstr ""
"第一个参数从 ``const GDExtensionInterface *p_interface`` 改为 "
"``GDExtensionInterfaceGetProcAddress p_get_proc_address``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:282
msgid ""
"The constructor for the `init_obj` variable now receives "
"``p_get_proc_address`` as its first parameter"
msgstr ""
"`init_obj` 变量的构造函数现在会接收 ``p_get_proc_address`` 作为第一个参数"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:284
msgid ""
"You also need to add an extra ``compatibility_minimum`` line to your "
"``.gdextension`` file, so that it looks something like:"
msgstr ""
"你还需要在你的 ``.gdextension`` 文件中额外添加一行 "
"``compatibility_minimum``，使其看起来类似于："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:293
msgid ""
"This lets Godot know that your GDExtension has been updated and is safe to "
"load in Godot 4.1."
msgstr ""
"这会让 Godot 知道你的 GDExtension 已经更新，可以在 Godot 4.1 中安全加载。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.2.rst:4
msgid "Upgrading from Godot 4.1 to Godot 4.2"
msgstr "从 Godot 4.1 升级到 Godot 4.2"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.2.rst:6
msgid ""
"For most games and apps made with 4.1 it should be relatively safe to "
"migrate to 4.2. This page intends to cover everything you need to pay "
"attention to when migrating your project."
msgstr ""
"对于大多数使用 4.1 制作的游戏和应用程序来说，迁移到 4.2 应该相对安全。本页旨"
"在介绍迁移项目时需要注意的所有事项。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.2.rst:13
msgid ""
"If you are migrating from 4.1 to 4.2, the breaking changes listed here might "
"affect you. Changes are grouped by areas/systems."
msgstr ""
"如果你要从 4.1 迁移到 4.2，这里列出的破坏性更改可能会影响到你。更改按照领域/"
"系统分组。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.2.rst:18
msgid ""
"The :ref:`class_Mesh` resource format has changed in 4.2 to allow for "
"`vertex and attribute compression <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/"
"81138>`__. This allows for improved rendering performance, especially on "
"platforms constrained by memory bandwidth such as mobile."
msgstr ""
":ref:`class_Mesh` 资源格式在 4.2 中已更改，以允许 `顶点和属性压缩 <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/81138>`__ 。这个更改可以提高渲染性能，尤其"
"是在受内存带宽限制的平台（例如移动设备）上。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.2.rst:23
msgid ""
"It is still possible to load the Godot 4.0-4.1 Mesh formats, but it is "
"**not** possible to load the Godot 4.2 Mesh format in prior Godot versions. "
"When opening a Godot project made with a version prior to 4.2, you may be "
"presented with an upgrade dialog that offers two options:"
msgstr ""
"仍然可以加载 Godot 4.0-4.1 Mesh 格式，但在之前的 Godot 版本中 **不可能** 加"
"载 Godot 4.2 Mesh 格式。打开使用 4.2 之前版本创建的 Godot 项目时，可能会出现"
"一个升级对话框，其中会提供两个选项："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.2.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Restart & Upgrade:** Upgrades the mesh format for all meshes in the "
"project and saves the result to disk. Once chosen, this option prevents "
"downgrading the project to a Godot version prior to 4.2. Set up a version "
"control system and push your changes *before* choosing this option!"
msgstr ""
"**重启并升级：** 升级项目中所有网格的网格格式，并将结果保存到磁盘。一旦选择，"
"此选项可以防止将项目降级到 4.2 之前的 Godot 版本。请设置版本控制系统，并在 *"
"选择此选项之前* 推送你的更改！"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.2.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Upgrade Only:** Upgrades the mesh format in-memory without writing it to "
"disk. This allows downgrading the project to a Godot version older than 4.2 "
"if you need to do so in the future. The downside is that loading the project "
"will be slower every time as the mesh format needs to be upgraded every time "
"the project is loaded. These increased loading times will also affect the "
"exported project. The number and complexity of Mesh resources determines how "
"much loading times are affected."
msgstr ""
"**仅升级：** 升级内存中的网格格式，但不将升级结果写入磁盘。如果将来有需要，这"
"个设置可允许你将项目降级回到 4.2 之前的 Godot 版本。这个设置的缺点是每次加载"
"项目都会变慢，因为每次加载项目时都需要升级网格格式。这些增加的加载时间也会影"
"响导出的项目。 Mesh 资源的数量和复杂度决定了加载时间受影响的程度。"

