#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:56
msgid "CSG tools features"
msgstr "CSG 工具功能"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:58
msgid "Every CSG node supports 3 kinds of boolean operations:"
msgstr "每个 CSG 节点都支持 3 种布尔运算："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Union:** Geometry of both primitives is merged, intersecting geometry is "
"removed."
msgstr "**并集（Union）：**\\ 合并两个图元的几何体，删除交叉的几何体。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:62
msgid ""
"**Intersection:** Only intersecting geometry remains, the rest is removed."
msgstr "**交集（Intersection）：**\\ 只保留相交的几何体，其余的被删除。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:63
msgid ""
"**Subtraction:** The second shape is subtracted from the first, leaving a "
"dent with its shape."
msgstr ""
"**差集（Subtraction）：**\\ 从第一种形状中减去第二种形状，留下一个凹陷的形"
"状。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:71
msgid "CSGPolygon"
msgstr "CSGPolygon"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:73
msgid ""
"The :ref:`CSGPolygon3D <class_CSGPolygon3D>` node extrude along a Polygon "
"drawn in 2D (in X, Y coordinates) in the following ways:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CSGPolygon3D <class_CSGPolygon3D>` 节点通过下列方式沿着以 2D（X、Y 坐"
"标）绘制的多边形挤出："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:76
msgid "**Depth:** Extruded back a given amount."
msgstr "**Depth：**\\ （深度）挤出一定量。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:77
msgid "**Spin:** Extruded while spinning around its origin."
msgstr "**Spin：**\\ （旋转）围绕原点旋转时挤出。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:78
msgid ""
"**Path:** Extruded along a Path node. This operation is commonly called "
"lofting."
msgstr "**Path：**\\ 路径，沿路径节点挤出。该操作通常称为放样。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:85
msgid ""
"The **Path** mode must be provided with a :ref:`Path3D <class_Path3D>` node "
"to work. In the Path node, draw the path and the polygon in CSGPolygon3D "
"will extrude along the given path."
msgstr ""
"**Path** 模式必须需要一个 :ref:`Path3D <class_Path3D>` 节点来运行。在 Path 节"
"点中绘制路径，CSGPolygon3D 中的多边形将沿给定路径挤出。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:91
msgid "Custom meshes"
msgstr "自定义网格"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:93
