"`WebAssembly <https://webassembly.org/>`__ ， `WebGL <https://"
"www.khronos.org/webgl/>`__ 以及`SharedArrayBuffer <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/"
"SharedArrayBuffer>`__ 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_web.rst:19
#, fuzzy
