"2D 和 3D 版本的 NavigationAgent 分别"
"是 :ref:`NavigationAgent2D<class_NavigationAgent2D>` "
"和 :ref:`NavigationAgent3D<class_NavigationAgent3D>`\\ 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/navigation/navigation_using_navigationagents.rst:15
