msgstr ":ref:`class_SegmentShape2D`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/physics/collision_shapes_2d.rst:36
msgid ":ref:`class_SeparationRayShape2D` (designed for characters)"
msgstr ":ref:`class_SeparationRayShape2D` （专为角色设计）"

