#: ../../docs/tutorials/physics/interpolation/physics_interpolation_introduction.rst:143
msgid "Calculating the interpolated position"
msgstr "计算插值位置"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/physics/interpolation/physics_interpolation_introduction.rst:145
msgid ""
"Once we have the interpolation fraction, we can insert it into a standard "
