#: ../../docs/tutorials/physics/interpolation/physics_interpolation_introduction.rst:152
msgid "So substituting our ``x_prev`` as 10, and ``x_curr`` as 30:"
msgstr "将 ``x_prev`` 替换为 10，将 ``x_curr`` 替换为 30："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/physics/interpolation/physics_interpolation_introduction.rst:160
