#: ../../docs/tutorials/physics/interpolation/physics_interpolation_introduction.rst:174
msgid "Smoothed transformations between physics ticks?"
msgstr "物理周期之间的平滑变换？"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/physics/interpolation/physics_interpolation_introduction.rst:176
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Putting all this together shows that it should be possible to have a nice "
"smooth estimation of the transform of objects between the current and "
"previous physics tick."
msgstr ""
"综合以上内容可以看出，应该能够在当前和上一物理帧之间对物体的变换进行良好的平"
