msgstr "挂起事件接口包含两个方法："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/plugins_for_ios.rst:86
msgid ""
"``get_pending_event_count()`` Returns the number of pending events on the "
"queue."
msgstr "``get_pending_event_count()`` 返回队列中挂起事件的数量。"

