"分为几个部分："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/editor/import_plugins.rst:303
msgid ""
"The first part of our import method opens and reads the source file. We use "
"the :ref:`FileAccess <class_FileAccess>` class to do that, passing the "
"``source_file`` parameter which is provided by the editor."
msgstr ""
"导入方法的第一部分打开并读取源文件。我们使用 :ref:`FileAccess "
"<class_FileAccess>` 类来执行该操作，并传递编辑器提供的 ``source_file`` 参数。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/editor/import_plugins.rst:307
