#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:487
msgid "Non-game application"
msgstr "非游戏应用"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.rst:489
msgid ""
"Set the base window width and height to the smallest window size that you "
