msgstr ""
"可指定自定义图标名称（需严格匹配Godot源码库`editor/icons <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/tree/master/editor/icons>`__文件夹中的图标文件名），也可通"
"过`Godot编辑器图标网站 <https://godot-editor-icons.github.io/>`__浏览可用图"
"标。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:518
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
