msgstr ""
"**我们可以删除现有的场景。**\\ :ref:`SceneTree.change_scene_to_file() "
"<class_SceneTree_method_change_scene_to_file>` "
"和 :ref:`SceneTree.change_scene_to_packed() "
"<class_SceneTree_method_change_scene_to_packed>` 都会立即删除当前场景。当然开"
