"某样东西以Alpha值渲染时, 它会被绘制为背景上的透明物体. 因"
"为 :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` 的默认背景是不透明的, 所"
"以 :ref:`Viewport Texture <class_ViewportTexture>` 的 ``alpha`` 通道是 "
"``1`` , 导致行星纹理的颜色略微变淡, 并且到处的 ``Roughness`` 值都是 ``1`` . "
"为了纠正这个问题, 我们转到 :ref:`SubViewport <class_SubViewport>` 并启用 "
"\"Transparent Bg\" 属性. 由于现在是在另一个透明物体上渲染, 要启用 "
"``blend_premul_alpha`` :"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/using_viewport_as_texture.rst:299
msgid ""
"This pre-multiplies the colors by the ``alpha`` value and then blends them "
"correctly together. Typically, when blending one transparent color on top of "
"another, even if the background has an ``alpha`` of ``0`` (as it does in "
