"desktop platforms, but it can have an impact on low-end mobile devices."
msgstr ""
"字体渲染的基础开销较高。桌面平台上通常无法察觉，但是会影响低端移动设备。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:369
msgid ""
