msgstr "我们希望将合成层定位在眼睛高度，并且距离玩家大约 1 到 1.5 米的位置。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/openxr_composition_layers.rst:82
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We now assign the SubViewport to the ``Layer Viewport`` property and enable "
"Alpha Blend."
