"现在我们将 SubViewport 分配给 ``Layer Viewport`` 属性并启用 Alpha Blend。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/openxr_composition_layers.rst:87
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As the player can walk away from the origin point, you will want to "
