"tree/master/xr/openxr_hand_tracking_demo>`_."
msgstr ""
"上图中的Control Gallery演示可以 `在GitHub <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-demo-projects/tree/master/gui/control_gallery>`__ 上找到。"

